Z||000000||bpfiero||04-27-2001||01:40 PM||||well I was on my way to pick up some paper work for the upcoming Carlyle show when a nissan 240 sx pulls up next to me,  as it is I was running late already and my gas gauge was barely above the E. so and this guy wants to try to give me a run.  first he asked, what kind of car mine was,  then says fiero???  Like he'ed never seen one before (thought that was funny).  so he follows me to the Long island Express way,we slow to about 30-35 when we both look at each other and he takes off,  I down shift into 2nd and took off after him, he shifted into I think 4th when I'm in the middll of 3rd now and start passing him,  he shifed again and it was over,  I get into 4th and he couldn't catch me. now,..... I'm all happy  that I just got my car back on the road after one of my ignition wires fried,  and the first night out was starting off good,  until I ran out of gas 2 seconds later,  Thank God the fiero can coast a pretty long distance,  or else I would be a walking fool.  mad it almost all the way to the gas station, only because of a light after I got off of the exit. pushed her for about 1 min and filled her up,  then , off I was to Deer Park Ave.  don't know if anybody out there herd of it,  but for those who have ,you know how much fun that street is. just thought I share that with you guys,<P>play hard<BR>DRIVE FAST<BR>bpfiero||||reg||6
